{"id":"5964","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5964_main_invading-cirrostratus-nebulosus-and-cirrus-uncinus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图为缓慢侵入的均匀卷层云纱；<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">连续的云纱</span>在地平线上不到45°。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">钩卷云</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">毛卷云</span>的单个长云素是在卷层云之前。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">淡</span>云种积云和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎</span>云种积云都在照片的前景中。一些积云单体的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">圆弧顶</span>看似正发展成中云；然而，并没有进一步发展。</p>\n<p>在一个碎积云单体上可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">波涛状</span>附加特征。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰，赫尔辛基","latitude":"纬度: 60° 0' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 25° 0' 0'' E","date":"07 September 2011 1211 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 1, CM= 0, CH= 5","code":"图像P/S代码: P.3.12","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.3.12"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5964_syn_invading-cirrostratus-nebulosus-and-cirrus-uncinus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>抵近的暖锋生成了图中的高空云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5964_upper_invading-cirrostratus-nebulosus-and-cirrus-uncinus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>探测是在9小时前，在西北方向450公里。由于锢囚缓慢移动，因此认为这次探测具有代表性。探测显示出干燥中层以及从7000米到对流层顶的大量水汽。探测没有诊断出显著的温度平流，但高空风与锋面相当平行，这表明它是冷锢囚。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5964_sat_invading-cirrostratus-nebulosus-and-cirrus-uncinus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>EUMETSAT卫星9号通道图像摄于照片拍摄前3小时。它清晰地显示出在芬兰赫尔辛基以西的卷云前缘和卷层云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT/NEODAAS/University of Dundee","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}